// CH1 - Certutil (LOLBins) - BYPASSED  |  ADE3-01 Process Cloning
// Rule intent : catch certutil.exe used to download a payload (-urlcache/-split).
// The bug     : the rule identifies the tool by PROCESS NAME. The attacker ran a
//               RENAMED copy of certutil (svc_update.exe) - still certutil, same
//               download - so `Process has "certutil.exe"` never matches.
// Try it      : this returns NOTHING on the CTF data. That empty result IS the bypass.
ProcessCreate_CH1
| where Process has "certutil.exe"
